<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Kelgran first half shr up, upbeat on H2.</title>
<headline>Kelgran first half shr up, upbeat on H2.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     20.6	  vs 15.3</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 8.5	   vs 7.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   16.24	 vs 10.87</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   18.73	 vs 11.28</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.09	  vs 0.41</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   4.84	  vs 2.66</p>
<p>    Turnover		  206.77	vs 147.90</p>
<p>Div payable April 10</p>
<p>on register February 28</p>
<p>Full name: Kelgran Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Granite producer Legran said seond half results should be better than the first half.</p>
<p>The company is offering capitalisation shares in lieu of the cash dividend, determined on the basis that 9.0 cents bears to the average share price on April 4.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
